      "text": "store \u00b7 reparse \u00b7 edit_blocks\ndelete \u00b7 delete_audio\ndelete_summaries \u00b7 rebuild\n\nEditing text keeps the ids, so\nthe audio survives. Removing a\nblock shifts every id after it,\nso the audio must go.",
      "originalText": "store \u00b7 reparse \u00b7 edit_blocks\ndelete \u00b7 delete_audio\ndelete_summaries \u00b7 rebuild\n\nEditing text keeps the ids, so\nthe audio survives. Removing a\nblock shifts every id after it,\nso the audio must go.",
