      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "Blocks lie end to end with a gap:\n350 ms, or 700 ms after a heading.\n\nA cue opens half a gap BEFORE the\nfirst word, so the highlight leads\nthe voice by ~175 ms. Anything slow\nlands in the run-up, not inside a\nword. The audio is untouched;\nonly the map moves.",
      "originalText": "Blocks lie end to end with a gap:\n350 ms, or 700 ms after a heading.\n\nA cue opens half a gap BEFORE the\nfirst word, so the highlight leads\nthe voice by ~175 ms. Anything slow\nlands in the run-up, not inside a\nword. The audio is untouched;\nonly the map moves.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
