      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "Blocks render as <p>, never\n<button>: every attempt to select\na paragraph started playback.\nThe timing payload is embedded in\nthe page, so nothing is fetched.",
