      "type": "text",
      "x": 1324,
      "y": 2560,
      "width": 392,
      "height": 195.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "A requestAnimationFrame loop reads\naudio.currentTime and finds the\nblock by binary search over the\npayload. Measured at 2 ms.\n\nPlus a seeked listener: media-chrome\nowns the skip buttons and the scrub\nbar and moves the playhead itself.\n\ncuechange is the backstop for a\nbackground tab, where frames stop\nand audio does not.",
      "originalText": "A requestAnimationFrame loop reads\naudio.currentTime and finds the\nblock by binary search over the\npayload. Measured at 2 ms.\n\nPlus a seeked listener: media-chrome\nowns the skip buttons and the scrub\nbar and moves the playhead itself.\n\ncuechange is the backstop for a\nbackground tab, where frames stop\nand audio does not.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 13
